úncia: Word stress","items":[{"label":"Word stress","note":"Palavras de 2+ sílabas têm uma sílaba forte: eDUcaTION, comPUter, PHOtograph, phoTOgraphy.","words":["education","photograph","photography","develop","different"]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Use break down.","pt":"Use.","model":"My car broke down."},{"q":"Use mind + -ing.","pt":"Use.","model":"I don’t mind waiting."},{"q":"Recommend a book.","pt":"Recomende.","model":"I suggest reading it slowly."}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write a 6-line review of a book about hard times.","model":"This honest book is about a woman whose life breaks down after losing her job. She doesn’t mind admitting her fear. She learns to ask for help. The author avoids using big words. I suggest reading it slowly. It is worth your time.","checklist":["Usei **break down**","Usei **verbo + -ing**","Resenha curta"],"words":"6 linhas"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “honest book” mean?","opts":["emprego perdido","livro sincero","admissão de medo"],"ans":1,"why":"**honest book** = livro sincero."},{"q":"What does “lost job” mean?","opts":["crise de vida","palavras simples","emprego perdido"],"ans":2,"why":"**lost job** = emprego perdido."},{"q":"What does “life crisis” mean?","opts":["crise de vida","admissão de medo","leitura lenta"],"ans":0,"why":"**life crisis** = crise de vida."},{"q":"What does “fear admission” mean?","opts":["palavras simples","admissão de medo","jornada emocional"],"ans":1,"why":"**fear admission** = admissão de medo."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Estratégia para as provas","body":["Treine esta habilidade com o formato de tarefas curtas das provas (TOEFL/IELTS).","Leia o enunciado primeiro e procure as palavras-chave."]},{"type":"box","kind":"teach","t":"Nota para o futuro p